<title>CHINA: SOCCER-CHINA BEAT VIETNAM 4-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CHINA BEAT VIETNAM 4-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>China beat Vietnam 4-0 (halftime</p>
<p>2-0) in their World Cup Asian zone group eight qualifying match</p>
<p>on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Fan Zhiyi 6, Hao Haidong 44, Ma Mingyu 64, Su</p>
<p>Maozhen 67</p>
<p>    Standings	P   W   D   L   F   A   Pts</p>
<p> China		 6   5   1   0  13   2    16</p>
<p> Tajikistan	  5   3   1   1  10   2    10</p>
<p> Turkmenistan	5   2   0   3   8   8     6</p>
<p> Vietnam	     6   0   0   6   2  21     0</p>
<p>Remaining match: Sunday - Tajikistan v Turkmenistan</p>
</text>
